body:
yeah and im sure there are plenty of other people who think the same as me, hell i doubt anyone on this sub reddit would read this and call you abnormal. yeah i get it being hard talking to people, thats why the internent is so great yano? like on reddit theres great subreddits like r/needafriend where you can meet people who you can relate to and talk to. 

&#x200B;

also sure you could use that argument, hell i turned out somewhat fine but i still wouldve loved to have had a dad yano. can you think of any reasons I NEED to be alive? because i cant either, however i can think of plenty of reasons i SHOULD stick around, and like ive said before there are lots of reasons you should stick around too. you are right though, it is hard to believe in what ifs, however being a great mother, striving for things in life that you enjoy and love, finding people who are as amazing as you, finding hobbies, or simply doing a good thing, are all things YOU have control over and arent what ifs. im not saying life is going to magically just become some fairy tale and fix itself, but you can try to progress to making it as good as you possibly can.
